  "prompt": "A surrealist oil painting in René Magritte's distinct style. a large silhouette of a man in a bowler hat, seen from behind, acts as a transparent portal split into two scenes. The upper portion (head and shoulders) shows a clear light blue gradient night sky with a single sharp crescent moon centered at the forehead, just below the hat brim. The lower portion (torso and legs) contains a detailed indoor study: a simple wooden writing desk and empty wooden chair at an angled perspective, loose white papers scattered on the desk and floor, and a single tiny glowing red dot near the lower right floor area. Visible brushstrokes and canvas texture throughout. Diffused, contemplative lighting originates from the night sky within. --ar 5:7 --raw --sref 8091516345 --profile wws4mer jiv519w --v 8.1",
